-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8B%BC%E7%BE%A4\" title=\"狼群\"><img alt=\"狼群\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-301501.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-301501.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8B%BC%E7%BE%A4\" title=\"狼群\">狼群</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.5</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>红土地</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：301503</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能1</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3015/301503/技能一.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3015/301503/技能一 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3015/301503/技能二.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3015/301503/技能二 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3015/301503/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3015/301503/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3015/301503/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3015/301503/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">田径项目，本该是最原始的运动：标枪和石块，帮助你抓住和杀死猎物，而短跑与跳跃，则让你不至沦为猎物。<br />然而时至今日，标枪重心的位置为了安全多次调整，起跳的方式为了公平再三细化。哪怕是在这片黄沙漫天的土地上，佩戴目镜和护腕都已经成了流程的一环。<br />他遵守规则，但并不认同这一切。难道说一匹野狼会因为享用人类的冰淇淋，佩戴人类的护具，而变成另一种存在吗？断然不会。<br />野性是他的自我，他的力量。为了守护他新的“族群”，他绝不会将之抛弃。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"301503\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301504.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/30/Belonging-301504.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">热塑胶运动眼镜<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Thermoplastics Sport Glasses</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>因运动员常沉浸于坠落而下的快感，忘记树杈与碎石的威胁，运动眼镜成为强制佩戴的护具之一。<br />但据说，他是为数不多的反对者。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301505.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/41/Belonging-301505.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">万全之备<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Backup Plan</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>由乌卢鲁运动会后勤部门统一发放，为所有运动员提供同等的帮助与防护。<br />耐磨而简易的工业产品，若能忍耐乏味单调的色彩，这确实是最优选择。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301506.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/39/Belonging-301506.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">跃于足下<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">The Leaper</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>鞋口紧致，软钉遍布鞋底，脚掌与大地因此紧密贴近。<br />每任冠军的鞋子都能卖出高价格，而每一道留下的擦痕也能为此加码。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%BC%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%831.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 狼之跃1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%BC%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%831.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%BC%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%831.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\